{"id":"o7lu3coa7bq20s6x1vug39lsb","title":"城市乌鸦与乡村乌鸦看待世界的方式不同","originalTitle":"City crows and country crows don't see the world the same way","summary":"一项新研究发现，城市乌鸦比乡村乌鸦更害怕新事物。在纽约伊萨卡及其周边地区的城市与乡村乌鸦家庭中进行的实验表明，城市乌鸦对新物体表现出更大的畏怯，而乡村乌鸦则对人类更为警惕。研究还揭示，乌鸦的社交行为和适应策略有助于它们在城市环境中寻找有用的信息。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Phys.org"},"links":{"original":"https://phys.org/news/2026-11-city-crows-country-dont-world.html"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-16T18:40:12.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-16T19:05:35.776Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-16T19:05:35.776Z","category":"neuroscience","tags":["研究成果","DeepMind","OpenAI","NVIDIA"],"score":49,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"b65bfcb9-d9a6-4c75-ba22-e3441bada8ef","title":"城市与乡村乌鸦对新事物和人类警惕性差异研究"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"b65bfcb9-d9a6-4c75-ba22-e3441bada8ef","title":"城市与乡村乌鸦对新事物和人类警惕性差异研究"}],"topics":[],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"f1GOwavxHMRU","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}